<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Materials cuts lead price 3,000 yen.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Materials cuts lead price 3,000 yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Materials Corp said on Friday it reduced its selling price for lead by 3,000 yen to 122,000 yen a tonne, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The company periodically reviews its selling prices and changes them in line with market prices and currency rates.</p>
</text>
